    "description": "What: On test-town, 'Squad' (Friend, TKB 302) with 'Leader' and 'Rifleman 1-4' is ordered SquadMarch in a wedge (Shape 1) to (340,300), about 50 m from (296,280). No enemy. Shows the squad march drill (S3). Judge: (1) the squad's leader runs SquadMarch; (2) every member reaches the objective (a slot that does not work falls back to the lead's trail); (3) members keep their spacing (closest pair >= 2.5 m); (4) the march costs at most 5 move orders per sim second. Fail: a member never arrives, men bunch under 2.5 m, or the order rate is above 5 per second. Check: none (no live check); rail SquadTacticsScenarioTests (CE-2123 S3; the Order.Move variant is CE-2141, Hrot.ClusterRunner.Integration.Tests)."
